    "text": "CONCLUDED\n1 day ago\nA more capable and conversational Siri is here — featuring AI\nApple's revamped Siri features a new, dedicated Siri app, more conversational queries, current world knowledge and visual intelligence.\nApple demonstrated Siri looking up concert dates, setting reminders for ticket purchases and playing music. Another demo showed Siri fetching photos from a recent trip, adding photos to a shared album and sharing photos with others.\nNew updates also make Siri's voice more customizable and expressive.",
